--- behavioural check at a level this bench can actually exceed ---
  The case lists levels 10-95%%. On a 1 Gbps port level 10 == ~100 Mbps and
  level 95 == ~950 Mbps. This harness peaks at ~26 Mbps, so NONE of the
  listed levels can be exceeded here. Level 1 (~10 Mbps) can be, so the
  MECHANISM is demonstrated at level 1 and the listed levels are recorded
  as configuration-only.
